<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Dúvidas? Sugestões?</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            min-height: 100vh;
            background-color: #1d70b8;
        }

        /* Seção Principal (Azul) */
        .main-container {
            flex: 1;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-around;
            padding: 40px;
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .image-container {
            flex: 1;
            max-width: 450px;
            background-color: #fff;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }

        .image-container img {
            width: 100%;
            height: auto;
            border-radius: 8px;
            display: block;
        }

        .text-container {
            flex: 1;
            max-width: 500px;
            color: #ffffff;
            text-align: right;
        }

        .text-container h1 {
            font-family: 'Georgia', serif;
            font-size: 3.5rem;
            font-weight: normal;
            line-height: 1.1;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .text-container p {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            line-height: 1.4;
            opacity: 0.9;
        }

        /* Rodapé (Preto/Cinza Escuro) */
        footer {
            background-color: #111622;
            color: #ffffff;
            padding: 30px 40px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-around;
            align-items: flex-start;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
            border-top: 1px solid #222a3d;
        }

        .footer-column {
            flex: 1;
            max-width: 400px;
        }

        .left-column {
            text-align: center;
        }

        .right-column {
            text-align: center;
        }

        .school-name {
            font-weight: bold;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }

        /* Responsividade para telas menores */
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .main-container {
                flex-direction: column;
                text-align: center;
                padding: 20px;
            }

            .text-container {
                text-align: center;
                margin-top: 20px;
            }

            .text-container h1 {
                font-size: 2.5rem;
            }

            .text-container p {
                font-size: 1.2rem;
            }

            footer {
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 20px;
                text-align: center;
            }

            .left-column, .right-column {
                text-align: center;
                max-width: 100%;
            }
        }

        img {
            width: 600px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Seção Principal -->
    <main class="main-container">

        <div>
            <img src="https://i.imgur.com/TwlQerR.png">
        </div>
        
        <!-- Bloco de Texto -->
        <div class="text-container">
            <h1>Dúvidas?<br>Sugestões?</h1>
            <p>Entre em contato conosco usando um de nossos canais.</p>
        </div>

    </main>

    <!-- Rodapé de Contatos -->
    <footer>
        
        <!-- Coluna do Endereço -->
        <div class="footer-column left-column">
            <p class="school-name">Colégio RUI BARBOSA</p>
            <p>Rua das Acácias, 123, Apt. 45</p>
            <p>Bairro Jardim das Flores</p>
            <p>Cidade: São Paulo</p>
            <p>Estado: SP</p>
            <p>CEP: 04567-890</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Coluna dos Canais Digitais -->
        <div class="footer-column right-column">
            <p>Tel.: (12) 3456-7890</p>
            <br>
            <p>E-mail: enem.2027@gmail.com.br</p>
            <p>Redes sociais: @enem2027</p>
        </div>

    </footer>

</body>
</html>
